# pan-50 (M9): the plane pressed on its empty part and dragged 50 px right (CartesianPlane.test.tsx:
# "pans from the empty plane and says so while it does (a probe hides)"). At 1440 x 900 the plane
# is (488, 92, 936 x 792), its origin at (468, 396) in it at 50 px a unit (the reference's DOM and
# its canvas's data-origin-x/y); (700, 600) is x −5.12, y −2.24, under no mark's box, so Q follows
# the pointer there. Pressed and moved, the view follows the pointer, panX 1, the origin at (518,
# 396), Q hidden and the cursor the closed hand while it pans; held still 200 ms before the release,
# the last 120 ms hold no motion, so it doesn't fling, and Q comes back under the pointer.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 700 600
wait 500
shot probe
down
move 750 600 over 160
wait 16
shot panning
wait 200
up
wait 500
shot released
